### Change #3: App Router root layout — contains no `h1`

**File:** `services/frontend/app/layout.tsx`
**Action:** Use the **Write** tool to create this new file with exactly this content.

This is a server component (no `'use client'`), matching the `component-composition` pattern in `architecture.yaml`. It deliberately renders no heading so the page supplies the only `h1`.

